The  driver provides support for the (formerly TMP121 temperature
sensor with the API.  These devices are  connected  to  the  host
system with or 4‐wire serial busses.  The is capable of measuring
temperatures  with a 2 degree accuracy over the frame from ‐40 to
125 Celsius.  Temperatures are reported with a granularity of 625
microKelvins.  devices can transfer information at up  to  10MHz,
and support SPI mode 0.  The device reports itself with using the
generic  device name.  This name can be overridden, by specifying
an alternate name in the device property The driver  was  written
